WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:05.749
I got a new bike.

2
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:13.352
It is fast.

3
00:00:13.353 --> 00:00:20.261
The car is faster than the bike.

4
00:00:20.262 --> 00:00:28.029
The airplane is faster than the car.

5
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:35.158
The rocket is faster than the airplane.

6
00:00:35.159 --> 00:00:43.919
Wow! The rocket is the fastest.

7
00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:51.782
The airplane is slower than the rocket.

8
00:00:51.783 --> 00:00:57.855
The car is slower than the airplane.

9
00:00:57.856 --> 00:01:03.618
The bike is slower than the car.

10
00:01:03.619 --> 00:01:10.066
Oh no! My bike is the slowest.

11
00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:12.114
But I don't care!

12
00:01:12.115 --> 00:01:21.198
I like my new bike!

